{"3316150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "the doll museum", "steam_appid": 3316150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4962710], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE DOLL MUSEUM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay, listen up: This so-called 'Doll Queen' (who has zero style, by the way) collects lost souls for fun and actually thought she could turn ME, the beautiful Valentine, into a doll for her sad 'Museum of Misery'. As if I would ever fit into that ugly glass box!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.poster.avif?t=1784709507\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.webm?t=1784709507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.mp4?t=1784709507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So now I'm stuck here. And that’s exactly where you come in, bestie!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are going to help me escape the Queen's ridiculous traps. This museum is trying so hard to break my confidence and my will to fight back, but they totally underestimated me... and you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f4ef90d3c788fe7add90a4c7e4d2daa8.avif?t=1784709507\" width=1560 height=391 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/94ae360df48f83c4f5edec11d69bd75e.poster.avif?t=1784709507\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/94ae360df48f83c4f5edec11d69bd75e.webm?t=1784709507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/94ae360df48f83c4f5edec11d69bd75e.mp4?t=1784709507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AESTHETICS OF HORROR</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a world full of style, a pink vibe and encounters that are... well, to say the least, absolutely bonkers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ICONIC DECISIONS</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/b564a9042fe930d8996d96f888c41d7e.poster.avif?t=1784709507\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/b564a9042fe930d8996d96f888c41d7e.webm?t=1784709507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/b564a9042fe930d8996d96f888c41d7e.mp4?t=1784709507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control me, so YOU make the choices. Forget boring good-or-bad options, my feelings are  just as unpredictable as a cat that wants to cuddle one second and attacks you the next for no reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, bestie: Be sassy, but do it with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ After all, we are both way too good for basic horror anyway ✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRESSED FOR THE DOLL WAR</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/3483d7c9ebce77aa6e2e64ba7bdc9b0a.avif?t=1784709507\" width=1382 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just because I’m a prisoner doesn’t mean I have to look like a mess! So grab the prettiest outfit, bestie! If we are going to take down the system, we might as well do it in high heels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CATS, COOKIES &amp; COSMIC DRAMA</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/3ae3ea9e53fc61bb2fa30dede82df118.poster.avif?t=1784709507\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/3ae3ea9e53fc61bb2fa30dede82df118.webm?t=1784709507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/3ae3ea9e53fc61bb2fa30dede82df118.mp4?t=1784709507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, I’m being chased by killer dolls, but do you see that cat over there? It needs to be petted. That is non-negotiable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And speaking of things that are absolutely vital for survival: We seriously need to find the mysterious fortune cookies in the museum. They spit out cute little messages (depending on your zodiac sign). After all, I need to know if the stars are talking trash behind our backs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I AM THE HIGHLIGHT HERE</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/28111ed5f908e8ea14069dbd09547b4c.avif?t=1784709507\" width=1560 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise, bestie! I am made of plastic now, and no, it is not fantastic. Behind all these ridiculously soft colors and cute details, a creepy nightmare is hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But honestly: Do you really want to know what is behind this sugary-sweet facade? Then enter my world of pastel horror! But you better not ruin my outfit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY YOU HAVE TO PLAY THIS GAME (So basically, because of me</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span><strong>):</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices, my drama:</strong> An interactive story game with funny choices and multiple endings<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A thrilling exhibition tour:</strong> Explore this crazy museum at your own risk and solve small puzzles along the way<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sugary-sweet but psychotic:</strong> A mix of psychological horror and cute aesthetics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fortune teller with too many opinions:</strong> Tarot card readings with a sassy fortune teller who follows us through the game<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep dive into my psyche:</strong> Discover my trauma piece by piece<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting priorities:</strong> Collect all the hidden cats and fortune cookies in the museum<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surviving in style:</strong> Customize my outfits and accessories to fit your taste<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An intense quickie:</strong> Around 3-4 hours of playtime full of drama, style, and thrills. Perfect for an evening where you just want to save the world (and my outfit) real quick!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/3de9608367ca34bfa88ffeacb371df3d.avif?t=1784709507\" width=1560 height=436 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE DOLL MUSEUM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay, listen up: This so-called 'Doll Queen' (who has zero style, by the way) collects lost souls for fun and actually thought she could turn ME, the beautiful Valentine, into a doll for her sad 'Museum of Misery'. As if I would ever fit into that ugly glass box!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.poster.avif?t=1784709507\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27ac