09507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fortune teller with too many opinions:</strong> Tarot card readings with a sassy fortune teller who follows us through the game<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep dive into my psyche:</strong> Discover my trauma piece by piece<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting priorities:</strong> Collect all the hidden cats and fortune cookies in the museum<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surviving in style:</strong> Customize my outfits and accessories to fit your taste<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An intense quickie:</strong> Around 3-4 hours of playtime full of drama, style, and thrills. Perfect for an evening where you just want to save the world (and my outfit) real quick!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1784709507\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/3de9608367ca34bfa88ffeacb371df3d.avif?t=1784709507\" width=1560 height=436 /></span></p>", "short_description": "This 2D psychological horror game traps you in a pastel-pink doll museum, where you help Valentine to survive the cruel Doll Queen!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/ff7becfb38b28e4e372a3b31e91f9506f0f712e3/header.jpg?t=1784709507", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/a764ca1a080ed2e0799822a947756ce7c3787e52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784709507", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/a764ca1a080ed2e0799822a947756ce7c3787e52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784709507", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8.1 or later (Windows 10 recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL-compatible graphics card (minimum OpenGL 4.1)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.3 (High Sierra) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or Apple M1 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL-compatible graphics card (minimum OpenGL 4.1)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadb